{"id":"651349","name":"五香花生","author":"蓝雨阳光780913","authorId":"11379263","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/651349/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"花生","amount":"1000g"}],"sub":[{"name":"干辣椒","amount":"5个"},{"name":"花椒","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"八角","amount":"2个"},{"name":"三奈","amount":"2个"},{"name":"香叶","amount":"2片"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"生花生洗净沥水。","img":"images/651349/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放入小锅中，加入清水淹没花生。","img":"images/651349/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入干辣椒碎，花椒等调料。","img":"images/651349/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入盐，搅拌均匀煮30分钟。","img":"images/651349/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"煮30分钟后关火焖30分钟，便于入味。","img":"images/651349/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"捞出沥水。","img":"images/651349/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"花生里已经入味啦！","img":"images/651349/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}